  "content": "\n\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/c72yiPmFS_4?si=8Ah5plY5ecdyT6ND\" width=\"855\" height=\"450\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><em>Immersive Lanterns</em> 搭配 Accessories 模組使用，新增穿戴燈籠的功能，並支援動態光源與自訂擺動物理效果！</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172669/description_07ffa204-5555-4f4e-af62-0a714cbd392b.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/nRQKp3Thsz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Luna Pixel&color=393939&labelColor=0843bf&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kS7auUeYmc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/901654795100749884?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=Txni&labelColor=36633c&color=393939\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/txnimc/ImmersiveLanterns\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Github&color=393939&labelColor=666666&style=for-the-badge&logo=Github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/txni/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=393939&labelColor=fb594a&style=for-the-badge&logo=CurseForge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTxni\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=393939&labelColor=33de61&style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a></strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172669/description_8a85bc5f-6502-4f6a-bff8-a2bb83b4efcc.png\"></p>\n<p>受夠了要在副手拿盾牌或火把之間做抉擇了嗎？很簡單，製作一盞燈籠並蹲下右鍵點擊即可裝備到配件欄位！燈籠會懸掛在您的腰帶上，照亮您周圍的區域。當您在遊戲中移動時，第三人稱視角下燈籠會像鐘擺一樣晃動。</p>\n<p>雖然有幾款模組以類似方式為燈籠加入動態光源支援，但 Immersive Lanterns 是第一款全面相容於&nbsp;<strong>Iris 著色器包（shaderpacks）</strong>的模組，這些著色器包擁有專屬的動態光源系統。例如，如果您裝備靈魂燈籠並使用 Complementary 著色器，就會獲得藍色光源！</p>\n<p>Immersive Lanterns 提供 1.20.1 與 1.21.1+ 版本，支援 Forge 與 Fabric。在所有平台上，皆需依賴 Accessories 以及 Sodium/Embeddium Dynamic Lights 模組。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
